  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 3.9% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $14.08B (3.9% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/11/21/ether-treasury-firm-btcs-warns-sec-its-usd54-million-aave-loan-could-be-liquidated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ether treasury firm BTCS warns SEC its $54 million Aave loan could be liquidated</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/anthropic-ends-debut-up-17-as-ondo-launches-anton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Anthropic Ends Debut Up 17% as Ondo Launches ANTon</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/20/fairmint-plans-tokenized-stock-venue-on-canton-ethereum-under-sec-experiment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fairmint plans tokenized stock venue on Canton, Ethereum under SEC experiment</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPYVRIYWtPUFZNUlZCdEw1eldKRVkyRXEtWFB6MzJIamxReEdfS3JfYkRhQ0hOdWhINTdfcW9BcXdMRzhpWkd2T2RLQ1o5QnpJc1g3dTQ1bVE2M2wxekxkQkx5MFNVWHRZOTBhcjh1ZktpS0tvejdhQWJFVlFlMVFjSm1URXhmVTQyUEpNOUx5bU1GNEVhbW1yT0tOcmw3cF9BSU94WFVSVkNWalp1c2tLUTN2dGItTUY3bnU4MHkyT1EydDEw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Trump&#x27;s Democratic SEC pick suggests tokenization policy deserves full rule process</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
